        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Paper Boat Voyage is a multi-sensory interactive performance for children 5-9 yrs old, living with neurodiversity, including children with reduced mobility. In Paper Boat Voyage, everyone is invited to move and sing with the performers—adults [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
